      "content": "hey, i need some help looking into something weird. i keep getting these \"account not found\" errors on sites i've used for years. it's not just one, it's my old forum, my secondary email, even a social media profile i thought was secure. i know my passwords are right, i literally wrote them down. it feels like someone is systematically scrubbing my digital footprint. can you help me figure out if this is just a bunch of random glitches or if there's a pattern here? i feel like i'm being erased.",
