      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While a unified command system wiping accounts across unrelated platforms is highly unlikely without incredible, centralized access, the sequential nature of the losses points to something coordinated. The disappearance of support tickets further suggests deliberate administrative action rather than a simple technical bug. It is possible a shared piece of personal information, like an old username or associated recovery email, has been compromised and used to trigger deactivation across various platforms simultaneously. Re-evaluating what information links these different accounts is the critical next step.",
